{"updated":"2026-10-26T00:50:49.787Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"De75BOTk01O","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De75BOTk01O","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"終於幫Grok Bot蓋好大樓了\n越來越像一家公司了","timestamp":"2026-10-25T23:29:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T08:51:28+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De54kSugEW_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De54kSugEW_","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"最近看到「HEART 政策島」那個六邊形微縮地圖，突然腦洞大開\n如果把這個概念做成「台灣歷史島」會不會超好玩？🏝️\n\n以前背歷史年表背到睡著，但如果是像玩《文明帝國》或微縮模型一樣\n用 14 個六邊形拼成台灣番薯輪廓，每一格都是一個時代記憶\n\n點開「大稻埕」可以看到茶行與摩登女學生，順便解鎖「百年烏龍茶簍」給自己的小人背著走\n拉開「跨時代脈絡線」一條發光的線直接從 17 世紀熱蘭遮城的鹿皮貿易一路連到 21 世紀竹科的晶圓廠 ✨\n\n決定把這個坑挖起來，把【歷史教育 × 文化走讀 × 遊戲集章】放進同一個 3D 網頁裡","timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:50:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De544qtkwYZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De544qtkwYZ","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"台灣歷史島：\ntaiwan-history-island.vercel.app","timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:50:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De4R1bAgEhh","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De4R1bAgEhh","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"颱風天做了一款台灣縣市大戰的遊戲\n可以自己選擇一個縣市開始也可以觀看AI大亂鬥\n#遊戲 #颱風天 #縣市","timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:51:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De4SBuiE528","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De4SBuiE528","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"遊戲連結：malilion.github.io/taiwa…","timestamp":"2026-10-24T13:51:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"De6312xDCVE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De6312xDCVE","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"摩羯請進‼️\n這份檢核表，你或身邊的摩羯中了哪些？\n\n□ 不熟時容易臭臉，其實是怕說錯話 \n□ 怕得罪人，別人開口就盡力幫忙 \n□ 很愛逞強，不想讓別人看到脆弱 \n□ 做決定前，會先考慮各種可能 \n□ 感情需要慢慢來，不喜歡被緊迫盯人 \n□ 明明很在乎，卻不太會表達 \n□ 別人無心的一句話，自己腦補一大篇 \n□ 吵架時，你不說話，我也不說話 \n□ 怕說了讓對方難過，乾脆藏起心裡話\n\n大家覺得準嗎><","timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:00:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":122,"replies":1,"reposts":9,"shares":57},"score":151,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De633AwDBOh","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De633AwDBOh","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自➡️摩羯座真的是一個很奇妙的生物⬅️\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多星座主題的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-25T14:00:35.000Z","stats":{"likes":11,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De6xCVgDUxi","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De6xCVgDUxi","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"我想你整天刷脆也餓了吧～\n請大家吃一些懷舊零食\n歡迎留言補充","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:00:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":40,"replies":7,"reposts":2,"shares":1},"score":60,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De6xEx7jc3z","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De6xEx7jc3z","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"高機率會從中間斷掉","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:01:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De6xF4XDfxW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De6xF4XDfxW","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"一定要套在手指上","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:01:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De6qIY9jTdB","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De6qIY9jTdB","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"高級大人檢核表，你勾了幾項？\n\n□ 自己住外面 \n□ 自己負責學費、生活費 \n□ 自己打工、實習、面試 \n□ 會換螺絲、燈泡，通馬桶、洗手台 \n□ 能熟練地打電話訂房、預約 \n□ 自己和朋友出國 \n□ 會開車 \n□ 買東西會比價 \n□ 會煮飯 \n□ 過年包紅包給爸媽 \n□ 回家吃飯或採買，爸媽不用付錢 \n□ 帶爸媽出遊 \n□ 買車 \n□ 買房 \n□ 結婚生小孩 \n□ 帶爸媽看醫生 \n□ 成為股票大神 \n□ 成為房地產大神\n□ 打過官司／調解 \n□ 自己報稅 \n□ 創業\n\n大家覺得還有哪些條件呢？","timestamp":"2026-10-25T12:00:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":32,"replies":2,"reposts":2,"shares":5},"score":42,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De6qJr9DRWZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De6qJr9DRWZ","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"我還只是高級小孩。\n原文來自➡️變成高級大人的checklist⬅️\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多高級大人主題的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-25T12:00:48.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"De8AjjXk54T","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De8AjjXk54T","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"CapCut 宣布將接進 ChatGPT，從一句想法做出影片草稿，字幕、素材與時間軸也能串進工作流。它只是聊天插件，還是真的能讓 AI 動手剪片？這篇拆解官方公開的 MCP 與 Skills，看看生成、粗剪到人工精修如何銜接。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-26T00:35:48.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T08:51:28+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De8ArNSEwx9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De8ArNSEwx9","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-26T00:36:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T08:51:28+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De7ozmjmf4E","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De7ozmjmf4E","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"M5 Ultra滿血跑Deepseek V4.1 Flash 1017版，256K上下文","timestamp":"2026-10-25T21:08:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":9,"first