,"stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De6WcXyFGmT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De6WcXyFGmT","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:08:35.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":10},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De6EpAuij-e","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De6EpAuij-e","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"在iPhone 上原生運行 STEAM OS","timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:33:56.000Z","stats":{"likes":386,"replies":28,"reposts":12,"shares":269},"score":478,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"De1emkijYWQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/De1emkijYWQ","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"現在我叫 AI 工作絕對不打字了。\n\n之前用過很多語音輸入工具，要不就突然給我彈出簡體字，要不就訂閱費不便宜，乾脆自己做一個。自己用了兩三個月，不斷根據跟 Agent 的使用習慣去優化，還不完美，但以全本地運算來說已經很堪用了！\n\nEasyType：按住 Fn 講話，放開就輸入繁體中文，任何 App 都能用。語音全部在你的 Mac 上處理。\n\n目前公測中，所有功能免費、字數無上限。\n需要 Apple Silicon Mac、macOS 14 以上。\n\n用起來哪裡不順、哪裡聽錯，歡迎都多多回饋給我，讓我做得更好唷～🙏\n\n連結在底下～","timestamp":"2026-10-23T11:43:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":55,"replies":10,"reposts":0,"shares":34},"score":75,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De1enNCDQFc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/De1enNCDQFc","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"👉 easytype.dev","timestamp":"2026-10-23T11:43:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":8},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"De6EBzEkYnX","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De6EBzEkYnX","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"每日任務：對 Google AI 吐槽 (1/1)\n\nArgon 模型到底多嬌貴\n獨立一個 weekly limit 就算了\n連 reset 時間都是獨立的？\n\n假設你昨天 12 點 weekly reset\n只要你不去用 argon 他的 reset 時間就不會跑","timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:27:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De4T42NH0KC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De4T42NH0KC","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"出外旅行拍一大堆影片\n到底怎麼讓 AI 幫忙整理才有效率\n\n1. 檔案其實都有時間，用時間很快就能判斷出是不是同一個景點\n\n2. 讓 AI 去讀懂影片的重點，請他用 ffmpeg 截圖\n\n3. 如果能額外提供 GPX 檔案，AI 就能知道你一整天在哪裡，海拔高度多少，移動速度多少\n\n補：如果你的相機無法紀錄 GPS，可以用手機下載 App \n(我是用 OsmAnd Maps)\n可以設定每分鐘紀錄一次當下 GPS 資訊，最後匯出 GPX 檔案\n\n後續要自己剪影片，或是交給 AI 剪\n都能快速找到素材在哪\n\n追蹤就能看到下一 part\nAI 怎麼產生旅遊影片！","timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:07:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":228,"replies":15,"reposts":40,"shares":280},"score":378,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De4X1Urnx7K","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De4X1Urnx7K","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"這邊有產出影片的樣片可以看喔","timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:42:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De3aftZEc4x","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De3aftZEc4x","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Google 真的嫌自己還不夠複雜欸！\n之前把 CLI 跟 IDE 都改成 Antigravity 後\n\n現在 Google 又釋出一個 Preview 的 CLI 庫\n要不要猜猜看它叫什麼 ： gemini-api-cli\n\n功能上其實很不錯\n目前只開放使用 API Key \n可以用來產生\n\n- 基本 AI 問答 (flash 等模型)\n- 影片 (omni)\n- 圖片 (banana)\n- 音樂 (lyria)\n- 文字轉語音 (tts)\n\n簡單來說就是把平常需要用 Gemini 網頁才能做的影片圖片音樂\n可以讓 Claude 直接自由發揮 ( 但會產生對應 API 費用\n\nGoogle AI Pro 以上方案每月有 10 美金的 GCP 抵免額\n也能用在折抵這些 API 花費，沒有在用的人剛好可以參考","timestamp":"2026-10-24T05:46:16.000Z","stats":{"likes":33,"replies":17,"reposts":1,"shares":19},"score":70,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De0r2tEEZc4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De0r2tEEZc4","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Grok Bot 的教學文章\n那肯定要請 Grok Bot 自己來寫的\n\n把 10 月最近的更新加入\n和 8 月一開始的舊資訊做清理\n\n在 Grok Bot 做完測試後\n請他自己開這篇文章來更新\n有一種請他自己介紹自己的感覺","timestamp":"2026-10-23T04:20:14.000Z","stats":{"likes":16,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":26,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De0sucrkbTY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De0sucrkbTY","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"short.darrelltw.com/grok…","timestamp":"2026-10-23T04:27:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"De3v6jLm_F_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/De3v6jLm_F_","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"我整理了一份「不是大公司也能申請」的 SaaS 新創額度。\n​\n官網上那些大數字，像「最高 35 萬美元」，幾乎都要有創投或加速器推薦。\n沒募資的一人公司，實際拿得到的是 1 萬美元這個等級。\n​\n不過一年 1 萬美元的伺服器額度，對剛上線的 App 已經很夠用了。\n​\n這次整理了 4 家可以申請的方案：\n◼ Cloudflare\n◼ PostHog\n◼ Mixpanel\n◼ ElevenLabs\n​\n產品還沒上線的話，也附上可以先撐著用的免費方案。\n​\n收藏起來，或分享給正在做產品的朋友 ✨\n​\n金額為 2026 年 10 月官網資料，申請前以官網為準。","timestamp":"2026-10-24T08:53:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":96,"replies":2,"reposts":18,"shares":162},"score":154,"first_seen":"2026-10-26T00:57:17+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}